| FLUORESCENCE_PROBES | 348 | 924 | 11.7 / 13.5 | OUT |
| CLASSICAL_AI_FOR_IMAGING | 343 | 1095 | 11.5 / 16.0 | OUT |
| NANO_THERAPEUTICS | 297 | 612 | 10.0 /  8.9 | OUT |
| QUANTUM_SENSING_BIOMED | 146 | 238 | 4.9 /  3.5 | OUT (borderline; see 7.4) |
| QC_FOR_IMAGING | 89 | 179 | 3.0 /  2.6 | IN |
